  "about": "Panel photo sets for photos.mjs panel (references/cards.md, Panel photos; references/photos.md, Pexels). A set is one tone family: every panel photograph on a page comes from one set, so the panels share one look. Each set holds query themes (one per panel, dealt with history so pages differ), the Pexels colour and orientation filters that keep the search inside the family, the host attributes cards.css reads, and a prompt for a generated picture later (not built: OpenAI gpt-image at quality 2.5 low, or Google Flow). Never violet or lavender, never people, text, logos or a busy pattern behind a window.",
